{"id":"n24979-1-7","stage":4,"title":"이중 · 二重","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24979-1-7-1","ko":"이 상자는 단단한가요?","zh":"这个箱子结实吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"상자는","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상자는","audio":"/audio/4cb54e571296e1b48e8a.mp3"}},{"text":"단단한가요?","meaning":"结实，健壮","explanation":"단단하다：结实，健壮；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"단단하다","audio":"/audio/a95f2893084560fb1a3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28370","senseId":"2","lemma":"단단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단단한가요","audio":"/audio/47cd4e44886b8b5fc2cb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"a95f2893084560fb","term":"단단하다","zh":"结实，健壮","audio":"/audio/a95f2893084560fb1a3a.mp3","entryId":"28370","definition":"不柔弱或不松软，牢固而严实。","pronunciation":["단단하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ac58e9b90b6d69fdd8e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24979-1-7-2","ko":"바깥쪽 재료를 이중으로 붙여서 30킬로그램까지 견딜 수 있습니다.","zh":"外层材料采用了双层结构，能够承受30公斤的重量。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바깥쪽","meaning":"外层，外部","explanation":"바깥쪽：外层，外部","readings":[{"term":"바깥쪽","audio":"/audio/61568490555fa26f8b5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56361","senseId":"2","lemma":"바깥쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바깥쪽","audio":"/audio/61568490555fa26f8b5b.mp3"}},{"text":"재료를","meaning":"材料","explanation":"재료：材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재료","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71211","senseId":"1","lemma":"재료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재료를","audio":"/audio/aefc2eb191d91a1b2d12.mp3"}},{"text":"이중으로","meaning":"二重，双重","explanation":"이중：二重，双重；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이중","audio":"/audio/39820b3d9da0493bf9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24979","senseId":"1","lemma":"이중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이중으로","audio":"/audio/b53064fe4904d075c107.mp3"}},{"text":"붙여서","meaning":"粘，贴，粘贴","explanation":"붙이다：粘，贴，粘贴；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"붙이다","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60293","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙여서","audio":"/audio/0692555107da7dd8d9a6.mp3"}},{"text":"30킬로그램까지","meaning":"公斤","explanation":"킬로그램：公斤；30：数字。；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"킬로그램","audio":"/audio/71bba289c7b4a4443a68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72176","senseId":"1","lemma":"킬로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"30킬로그램까지","audio":"/audio/02fd20066ffe2e503097.mp3"}},{"text":"견딜","meaning":"承受，支撑，耐","explanation":"견디다：承受，支撑，耐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"견디다","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64366","senseId":"2","lemma":"견디다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"견딜","audio":"/audio/2efe01156e03bcdc7e86.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니다","audio":"/audio/de7385b84e32dd836700.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"61568490555fa26f","term":"바깥쪽","zh":"外层，外部","audio":"/audio/61568490555fa26f8b5b.mp3","entryId":"56361","definition":"在外面看到的部分。","pronunciation":["바깓쪽"]},{"id":"cff206505c96a240","term":"재료","zh":"材料","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3","entryId":"71211","definition":"用于制造物品的东西。","pronunciation":["재료"]},{"id":"39820b3d9da0493b","term":"이중","zh":"二重，双重","audio":"/audio/39820b3d9da0493bf9e0.mp3","entryId":"24979","definition":"两层；或指两层的东西。","pronunciation":["이ː중"]},{"id":"f50e3cbdb3c8dd13","term":"붙이다","zh":"粘，贴，粘贴","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3","entryId":"60293","definition":"使某物附在某处而不脱落。","pronunciation":["부치다"]},{"id":"71bba289c7b4a444","term":"킬로그램","zh":"公斤","audio":"/audio/71bba289c7b4a4443a68.mp3","entryId":"72176","definition":"重量单位。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"3d2b0fdac042ddf0","term":"견디다","zh":"承受，支撑，耐","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3","entryId":"64366","definition":"东西等受热或受压时维持原来的状态。","pronunciation":["견디다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7fa104addd451887ad2c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24979","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/